# a kit's key picked while playing: no preview over the beat (Steps' black key, a sound page's black key); stopped,
# the same keys sound it. On EDIT's pages a white key writes the key shown on its step (tests/scenarios/kitedit.xy);
# with EDIT held it plays, while playing too
wait 300
expect trk 1
tap PLAY
wait 200
tap SEQ
tapkey b1
wait 20
expect drumhits 0
tap EDIT
tapkey b2
wait 20
expect drumhits 0
key w3 down
wait 20
key w3 up
expect drumhits 0
expect note 1 1 4 3
press EDIT
key w3 down
wait 20
key w3 up
release EDIT
expect drumhits 1
tap PLAY
wait 300
tapkey b3
wait 20
expect drumhits 2
